              "message": "Refactor: separate Blender UI from core JBeam logic\n\nRestructures the addon from a monolithic __init__.py into a clean\nlayered architecture:\n\n- Extract all Blender-specific code into blender/ subpackage:\n  - state.py, properties.py, drawing.py, handlers.py\n  - operators/ (core, mesh_edit, nodes)\n  - panels/ (main, properties_panel, tools)\n\n- Create registration.py for all Blender class registration\n- Flatten __init__.py to bl_info + thin register/unregister stubs\n- Fix domain layer imports (jbeam/*.py -> core.utils)\n\n- Remove Blender text_editor dependency from jbeam/io.py via\n  dependency injection (read_file_fn parameter)\n- Reorganize third-party code under parsers/ and vendor/\n\nNo functional changes — pure code organization.\"",
